A: Here is a simple way to do it with the forloop package:
\documentclass{article}
\usepackage{forloop}

\begin{document}

\newcommand{\totalsections}{46}
\newcounter{i}
\forloop{i}{1}{\value{i} < \totalsections}{%
  \section{Section \arabic{i}}
}

\end{document}


